{"meta":{"id":"guide-rule","category":"aide/rules","title":"GUIDE 규칙","subtitle":"(탐색·생성 프로토콜)","summary":"탐색 프로토콜, AI 행동 규칙, 분류 기준, 생성 절차","tags":["aide","규칙","가이드"],"color":"slate","watermarkClass":"watermark-bg-linux-install","updatedAt":"2026-09-05"},"html":"<div class=\"absolute -top-12 -right-12 w-48 h-48 bg-slate-200/50 rounded-full blur-3xl opacity-70 pointer-events-none\"></div>\n<div class=\"absolute -bottom-16 -left-16 w-48 h-48 bg-indigo-100/50 rounded-full blur-2xl opacity-80 pointer-events-none\"></div>\n\n<div class=\"relative pb-5 border-b border-slate-200\">\n  <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-2.5\">\n    <span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold bg-slate-200 text-slate-700 border border-slate-300 tracking-wider\">\n      <span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-slate-600\"></span>\n      규칙\n    </span>\n    <span class=\"text-[11px] font-medium tracking-wide uppercase text-stone-400 font-serif\">aide Meta Rules</span>\n  </div>\n\n  <h1 class=\"text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-tight leading-snug\">\n    GUIDE 규칙 <span class=\"text-base sm:text-lg font-normal text-slate-600 font-serif\">(탐색·생성 프로토콜)</span>\n  </h1>\n\n  <div class=\"mt-3 flex items-start gap-2 bg-slate-100/80 border border-slate-200 rounded-xl p-3\">\n    <svg class=\"w-4 h-4 text-slate-600 shrink-0 mt-0.5\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\">\n      <path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path>\n    </svg>\n    <p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-700 leading-relaxed font-medium\">\n      <strong class=\"text-stone-900\">문서 범위:</strong> aide/ 지식베이스를 탐색·생성할 때 따르는 규칙(규칙/에만 존재)\n    </p>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"py-5 border-b border-stone-100\">\n  <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\">\n    <div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-slate-600\"></div>\n    <h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide uppercase\">탐색 규칙 (Rule 1~5)</h2>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"space-y-2 text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 pl-1\">\n    <div class=\"tip-bullet-row\">\n      <span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-slate-600\">•</span>\n      <span class=\"tip-bullet-content\"><strong class=\"font-bold text-stone-900\">Rule 1:</strong> 연결된 프로젝트의 AGENTS.md를 먼저 읽는다 (Claude Code는 CLAUDE.md가 자동으로 이어줌)</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"tip-bullet-row\">\n      <span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-slate-600\">•</span>\n      <span class=\"tip-bullet-content\"><strong class=\"font-bold text-stone-900\">Rule 2:</strong> aide/ 루트 GUIDE.md → 규칙/GUIDE.md 순으로 진입해 이 파일과 상황별 규칙을 확인</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"tip-bullet-row\">\n      <span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-slate-600\">•</span>\n      <span class=\"tip-bullet-content\"><strong class=\"font-bold text-stone-900\">Rule 3~4:</strong> GUIDE.md의 Navigation을 따라 가장 적합한 카테고리를 찾을 때까지 반복, 무관한 가지는 읽지 않음</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"tip-bullet-row\">\n      <span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-slate-600\">•</span>\n      <span class=\"tip-bullet-content\"><strong class=\"font-bold text-stone-900\">Rule 5:</strong> 최종 리프 디렉토리에서 콘텐츠 파일을 생성/조회</span>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"py-5 border-b border-stone-100\">\n  <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\">\n    <div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-slate-600\"></div>\n    <h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide uppercase\">넣을 것 / 뺄 것 판단 기준</h2>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"border border-stone-200 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-xs bg-white\">\n    <table class=\"table-fixed-layout text-left text-xs sm:text-sm\">\n      <thead>\n        <tr class=\"bg-stone-50/90 border-b border-stone-200 text-stone-600 text-[11px] sm:text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider\">\n          <th class=\"py-2.5 px-3 sm:px-4 w-[50%]\">✅ 넣을 것</th>\n          <th class=\"py-2.5 px-3 sm:px-4 w-[50%]\">❌ 뺄 것</th>\n        </tr>\n      </thead>\n      <tbody class=\"divide-y divide-stone-100 font-normal text-stone-700\">\n        <tr>\n          <td class=\"py-3 px-3 sm:px-4 text-stone-600 text-xs sm:text-[13px]\">AI가 못 짐작하는 명령어·설정값</td>\n          <td class=\"py-3 px-3 sm:px-4 text-stone-600 text-xs sm:text-[13px]\">코드/문서를 보면 알 수 있는 것</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td class=\"py-3 px-3 sm:px-4 text-stone-600 text-xs sm:text-[13px]\">기본값과 다른 규칙</td>\n          <td class=\"py-3 px-3 sm:px-4 text-stone-600 text-xs sm:text-[13px]\">이미 아는 표준 언어·프레임워크 관례</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td class=\"py-3 px-3 sm:px-4 text-stone-600 text-xs sm:text-[13px]\">흔한 함정, 비직관적 동작</td>\n          <td class=\"py-3 px-3 sm:px-4 text-stone-600 text-xs sm:text-[13px]\">\"코드를 깔끔하게 짜라\" 같은 당연한 얘기</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td class=\"py-3 px-3 sm:px-4 text-stone-600 text-xs sm:text-[13px]\">프로젝트/도메인 고유 결정</td>\n          <td class=\"py-3 px-3 sm:px-4 text-stone-600 text-xs sm:text-[13px]\">자주 바뀌는 정보</td>\n        </tr>\n      </tbody>\n    </table>\n  </div>\n  <p class=\"mt-2 text-[11px] text-stone-400\">기준 문장: \"이 줄을 지우면 실수하게 될까?\" — 아니라면 지운다.</p>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"py-5\">\n  <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-3\">\n    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n      <div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-slate-600\"></div>\n      <h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide uppercase\">카테고리 분류 기준</h2>\n    </div>\n    <span class=\"text-[11px] text-stone-400 font-medium\">5개 카테고리</span>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"border border-stone-200 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-xs bg-white\">\n    <table class=\"table-fixed-layout text-left text-xs sm:text-sm\">\n      <thead>\n        <tr class=\"bg-stone-50/90 border-b border-stone-200 text-stone-600 text-[11px] sm:text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider\">\n          <th class=\"py-2.5 px-3 sm:px-4 w-[30%]\">카테고리</th>\n          <th class=\"py-2.5 px-1 text-center w-[20%]\">단위</th>\n          <th class=\"py-2.5 px-3 sm:px-4 w-[50%]\">성격</th>\n        </tr>\n      </thead>\n      <tbody class=\"divide-y divide-stone-100 font-normal text-stone-700\">\n        <tr class=\"hover:bg-slate-50 transition-colors\">\n          <td class=\"py-3 px-3 sm:px-4\"><strong class=\"font-bold text-stone-900 font-mono\">1-rules</strong></td>\n          <td class=\"py-3 px-1 text-center text-stone-600 text-[11px]\">공통 설정</td>\n          <td class=\"py-3 px-3 sm:px-4 text-stone-600 text-xs sm:text-[13px]\">가이드(feedforward) — 문제 전에 예방</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr class=\"hover:bg-slate-50 transition-colors\">\n          <td class=\"py-3 px-3 sm:px-4\"><strong class=\"font-bold text-stone-900 font-mono\">2-tutorials</strong></td>\n          <td class=\"py-3 px-1 text-center text-stone-600 text-[11px]\">기능 단위</td>\n          <td class=\"py-3 px-3 sm:px-4 text-stone-600 text-xs sm:text-[13px]\">연동 예제 + 사용 시점/장단점</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr class=\"hover:bg-slate-50 transition-colors\">\n          <td class=\"py-3 px-3 sm:px-4\"><strong class=\"font-bold text-stone-900 font-mono\">3-modules</strong></td>\n          <td class=\"py-3 px-1 text-center text-stone-600 text-[11px]\">개념 단위</td>\n          <td class=\"py-3 px-3 sm:px-4 text-stone-600 text-xs sm:text-[13px]\">리프가 .md 아닌 실행 코드 파일</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr class=\"hover:bg-slate-50 transition-colors\">\n          <td class=\"py-3 px-3 sm:px-4\"><strong class=\"font-bold text-stone-900 font-mono\">4-error</strong></td>\n          <td class=\"py-3 px-1 text-center text-stone-600 text-[11px]\">언어 단위</td>\n          <td class=\"py-3 px-3 sm:px-4 text-stone-600 text-xs sm:text-[13px]\">센서(sensor) — 실패 교훈을 규칙으로 승격</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr class=\"hover:bg-slate-50 transition-colors\">\n          <td class=\"py-3 px-3 sm:px-4\"><strong class=\"font-bold text-stone-900 font-mono\">5-project</strong></td>\n          <td class=\"py-3 px-1 text-center text-stone-600 text-[11px]\">프로젝트 단위</td>\n          <td class=\"py-3 px-3 sm:px-4 text-stone-600 text-xs sm:text-[13px]\">AGENTS.md, 시스템 구성, 데이터 설계 등</td>\n        </tr>\n      </tbody>\n    </table>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"mt-2 bg-stone-50 border border-stone-200/80 rounded-2xl p-4 sm:p-4.5\">\n  <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-2.5\">\n    <svg class=\"w-4 h-4 text-slate-600\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n      <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M13 16h-1v-4h-1m1-4h.01M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z\"></path>\n    </svg>\n    <h3 class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold text-stone-900\">GUIDE.md 필수 구성 & 참고 자료 원칙</h3>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"space-y-2 text-stone-600 pl-1\">\n    <div class=\"tip-bullet-row\">\n      <span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-slate-600\">•</span>\n      <span class=\"tip-bullet-content\">루트를 제외한 GUIDE.md는 <strong class=\"font-bold text-stone-900\">Categories/Navigation 구조만, 20줄 이내</strong>로 작성. 리프 콘텐츠 파일은 150~200줄 목표.</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"tip-bullet-row\">\n      <span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-slate-600\">•</span>\n      <span class=\"tip-bullet-content\">디렉토리 분할 기준: <strong class=\"font-bold text-stone-900\">20개 이상이면 하위 카테고리 검토, 50개 이상이면 반드시 분리</strong>.</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"tip-bullet-row\">\n      <span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-slate-600\">•</span>\n      <span class=\"tip-bullet-content\"><strong class=\"font-bold text-stone-900\">생성을 위한 분석/*.md는 참고용일 뿐 정식 규칙이 아니다</strong> — 사람이 검토·선별한 뒤에만 1-rules 등으로 승격한다.</span>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"mt-5 pt-3 border-t border-stone-100 flex items-center justify-between text-[11px] text-stone-400\">\n  <span>aide Meta Rules</span>\n  <span>GUIDE 규칙</span>\n</div>\n","path":"aide/rules/guide-rule","breadcrumb":[{"id":"root","title":"Home","path":""},{"id":"aide","title":"aide","path":"aide"},{"id":"rules","title":"규칙","path":"aide/rules"}],"hasImage":false}